   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "10 games, 8 per player:\nLabel Detective → Gut Check →\n🎲 1 of [Peek & Pick | My Snack Week]\n→ Snack Moments / Showdown (adaptive)\n→ 🎲 2 of [Bid It | Stock the Shelf |\nBuild-a-Bar] → Guess the Crowd + bonus\n→ reality check → 1–5 rating (LAST)\n→ diagnostic follow-up → results\n\nRewards: progress, mystery gifts,\nskill & quality bonuses, badges\n(never tied to preference answers)",
   "originalText": "10 games, 8 per player:\nLabel Detective → Gut Check →\n🎲 1 of [Peek & Pick | My Snack Week]\n→ Snack Moments / Showdown (adaptive)\n→ 🎲 2 of [Bid It | Stock the Shelf |\nBuild-a-Bar] → Guess the Crowd + bonus\n→ reality check → 1–5 rating (LAST)\n→ diagnostic follow-up → results\n\nRewards: progress, mystery gifts,\nskill & quality bonuses, badges\n(never tied to preference answers)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
