   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Bayesian choice model (particles):\nprice, protein@functional, protein@craving,\ntaste → ₹/g WTP per context\nNext item = softmax(info gain − cost)\nCUSUM injects repeat / dominated probes\nStops at 4–10 items when certain\n🎲 Bonus-game rotation: value for this\nplayer + coverage balance → sampled,\npropensity stored for re-weighting",
   "originalText": "Bayesian choice model (particles):\nprice, protein@functional, protein@craving,\ntaste → ₹/g WTP per context\nNext item = softmax(info gain − cost)\nCUSUM injects repeat / dominated probes\nStops at 4–10 items when certain\n🎲 Bonus-game rotation: value for this\nplayer + coverage balance → sampled,\npropensity stored for re-weighting",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
