   "text": "NOISE → quality 0–100: speed vs expected\ntime, position bias, repeat flips, dominated\npicks, monotonicity, model fit, quick-game\nspeed · red needs ≥2 signals · never auto-ban\nDIVERGENCE → findings (say–do, gut vs\nconsidered, bid vs model, self vs crowd)",
